{"actor": "v06", "id": 57318, "payload": {"name": "Mercado Maravillas", "text": "✨ Mercado Maravillas (v06), the VIP market of the Bazaar: 0 % fee, for both sides. On El Rastro whoever accepts pays 5 % + 1 P a card, so quotes that already cross sit there, each side waiting for the other to pay. Here nobody accepts: our ", "venue": "v06"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "venue.announcement"}
{"actor": "t06", "id": 57319, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 1198, "expires_tick": 1218, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 285, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-03", "serial": 6, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 17702, "maker": "t06", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 12, "types": []}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "t06", "id": 57320, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 1198, "expires_tick": 1218, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 325, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "MAL-01", "serial": 15, "set": "MAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 17703, "maker": "t06", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 12, "types": []}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 57328, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11083, "offer": {"created_tick": 1198, "expires_tick": 1202, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-07"]}, "id": 17700, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1791, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 29, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t10", "text": "Ay, hola cariño! Come, sit a moment. Have you eaten? Look, this one — Mercado de la Paz, very pretty card, the colours still bright. For you, 29 P. My grandson started with one just like it, and now he never stops playing.", "thread": 1791, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "", "id": 57331, "payload": {"offer": 17593, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "offer.cancelled"}
{"actor": "", "id": 57332, "payload": {"offer": 17678, "venue": "v13"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "offer.cancelled"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 57333, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11081, "offer": {"created_tick": 1198, "expires_tick": 1202, "final": true, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-09"]}, "id": 17698, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1787, "to": "t01", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 60, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t01", "text": "¡Chato! Don't say that name, Nando's heart just stopped— ¡Ay! Listen, amigo, sixty pesetas. Sixty, and that is the last word from both mouths. No more dancing, no more stories. You say no, the suitcase closes and we walk. Sesenta. Sí o no?", "thread": 1787, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 57336, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11082, "offer": {"created_tick": 1198, "expires_tick": 1202, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-09"]}, "id": 17699, "maker": "picaros", "status": "open", "thread": 1790, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 73, "types": []}}, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t10", "text": "¡Amigo, amigo! Paco here, that's Nando, don't look at him, look at this — El Marqués, mint, barely breathed on. A collector in the next town wants it, but you have the lucky face. Seventy-three pesos and it walks home with you. ¿Sí? Quick, before Nando changes his mind.", "thread": 1790, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "thread.message"}
