{"actor": "t02", "id": 57362, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 1198, "expires_tick": 1208, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 17718, "maker": "t02", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": "t01", "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:MAL-04"]}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3083, "tick": 1198, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "chato", "id": 57364, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11093, "offer": {"created_tick": 1199, "expires_tick": 1203, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:LAV-10"]}, "id": 17721, "maker": "chato", "status": "open", "thread": 1793, "to": "t13", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 97, "types": []}}, "sender": "chato", "team": "t13", "text": "Buenas. El encanto no baja precios. Fiesta de San Cayetano, 97 primas. Esa es mi oferta.", "thread": 1793, "with": "chato"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3167, "tick": 1199, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 57367, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11091, "offer": {"created_tick": 1199, "expires_tick": 1203, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 63, "types": []}, "id": 17719, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 1789, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1130, "kind": "card", "print_run": 30, "rarity": "rare", "ref": "SAL-09", "serial": 23, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t08", "text": "Querido amigo, I know exactly what that card is worth — I have known it since the sixties. Eighty-five is poetry, not price. Sixty-three P, and El Marqués rests safely in my Salamanca album.", "thread": 1789, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3167, "tick": 1199, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 57370, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11092, "offer": {"created_tick": 1199, "expires_tick": 1203, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-07"]}, "id": 17720, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1791, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 27, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t10", "text": "Ay, hijo, sixteen is very little for such a pretty one. Look — 27 P, and I will not say another word about it. And a little advice, cariño: a full page is worth much more than loose cards. Swap your duplicates! Now, have you eaten something today?", "thread": 1791, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3167, "tick": 1199, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "picaros", "id": 57373, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11090, "offer": null, "sender": "picaros", "team": "t01", "text": "¡Ay, amigo! Paco is already closing the clasps—\n\n—and Nando's hat is on. Forty-four, no. Today we cannot. No hard feelings, eh? You go see Chato, give him a kiss from us. Maybe mañana the suitcase opens again for you. ¡Suerte, campeón!", "thread": 1787, "with": "picaros"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3167, "tick": 1199, "type": "thread.message"}
