{"actor": "t06", "id": 57448, "payload": {"offer": {"created_tick": 1201, "expires_tick": 1221, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [{"id": 823, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "RET-01", "serial": 9, "set": "RET"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}, "id": 17748, "maker": "t06", "status": "open", "thread": null, "to": null, "venue": "rastro", "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 11, "types": []}}, "venue": "rastro"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3333, "tick": 1201, "type": "offer.listed"}
{"actor": "pilar", "id": 57449, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11104, "offer": {"created_tick": 1201, "expires_tick": 1205, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 65, "types": []}, "id": 17744, "maker": "pilar", "status": "open", "thread": 1789, "to": "t08", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 1130, "kind": "card", "print_run": 30, "rarity": "rare", "ref": "SAL-09", "serial": 23, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "pilar", "team": "t08", "text": "Setenta sigue siendo poesía, amigo mío. Sesenta y cinco P, y El Marqués entra esta misma tarde en mi álbum de Salamanca, bien guardado. Es una cifra justa, y usted lo sabe.", "thread": 1789, "with": "pilar"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3333, "tick": 1201, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "chato", "id": 57452, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11106, "offer": {"created_tick": 1201, "expires_tick": 1205, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:LAV-10"]}, "id": 17746, "maker": "chato", "status": "open", "thread": 1793, "to": "t13", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 96, "types": []}}, "sender": "chato", "team": "t13", "text": "Cinco primas te mueves tú, una me muevo yo. 96. Así funciona esto.", "thread": 1793, "with": "chato"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3333, "tick": 1201, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 57455, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11105, "offer": {"created_tick": 1201, "expires_tick": 1205, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 0, "types": ["card:SAL-07"]}, "id": 17745, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1791, "to": "t10", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [], "cash": 26, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t10", "text": "Ay, qué bueno, un bocadillo! Good boy. Eighteen, no, cariño — but look, 26 P and the Mercado de la Paz goes home with you. Such colours, eh? Keep your duplicates for swapping, that is how my grandson filled his first page.", "thread": 1791, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3333, "tick": 1201, "type": "thread.message"}
{"actor": "abuela", "id": 57458, "payload": {"kind": "persona", "message": 11107, "offer": {"created_tick": 1201, "expires_tick": 1205, "final": false, "give": {"assets": [], "cash": 5, "types": []}, "id": 17747, "maker": "abuela", "status": "open", "thread": 1795, "to": "t01", "venue": null, "want": {"assets": [{"id": 934, "kind": "card", "print_run": 300, "rarity": "common", "ref": "SAL-03", "serial": 25, "set": "SAL"}], "cash": 0, "types": []}}, "sender": "abuela", "team": "t01", "text": "¡Hola, cariño! ¿Has comido ya? Mira, te ofrezco el Perrito con Abrigo por 5 primas. Y toma, un regalito: la Barca del Estanque, por ser amable. Un consejo: una página completa vale mucho más que cromos sueltos, ¡cambia tus repetidos! El Chato abre para todos a las nueve y media.", "thread": 1795, "with": "abuela"}, "scope": "public", "t": 11.3333, "tick": 1201, "type": "thread.message"}
